00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:51.790
and how organizations
are leveraging cloud

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:56.470
to drive productivity
and transformation

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:58.880
within particular
business units.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:02.390
And I'm based here
in the Bay Area,

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:07.610
and so we focus a lot on our
high-tech and now broader

00:04:07.610 --> 00:04:14.190
set of clients, on transforming
how new services and products

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.279
that they can develop
